#, menu
msgid "Upscaling to 4K"
msgstr "Uppskalning till 4K"

#: port/app/ingame.cpp:204
#, menu
msgid "How the picture is scaled to the screen: Bicubic is sharp, Hermite softer, Bilinear softer still."
msgstr "Hur bilden skalas till skärmen: Bikubisk är skarp, Hermite mjukare, Bilinjär ännu mjukare."

#: port/app/ingame.cpp:205
#, menu
msgid "Accurate barriers"
msgstr "Exakta barriärer"

#: port/app/ingame.cpp:206
#, menu
msgid "Off can raise the frame rate, but some games then flicker or show wrong shadows. It changes at once."
msgstr "Av kan höja bildfrekvensen, men vissa spel flimrar då eller visar fel skuggor. Gäller direkt."

#: port/app/ingame.cpp:207 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:474 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:495
#, menu
